{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "N42n0018_p0018a04"}
{"id": null, "n": "0174001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0174001", "type": "orig", "text": "vessantara-jātaka Cariyāpiṭakā 9; Jātakamālā9；六度集經二、一四。須太拏經（大正藏卷三．七c）太子須太拏經（同四一八c）有部藥事一四（同卷二四、六四c）有部破僧事一六（同一八一a）大智度論一二（同卷二五、三〇四c）菩薩本緣經上（同卷三、五五a）等參照。漢譯則為須太拏（Sudāna）有關此點見南海寄歸傳四（大正藏卷五四、二二八a）。又此圖有各處彫刻繪畫之描述。Sānchī 北門之物最為詳細（「逸見」中說為 Sānehī 諸塔之古代彫刻 46, 47, 58, 59），此外 Barāhut, Amarāvatī，犍陀羅、龜茲、燉煌等地亦有所見。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0174002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0174002", "type": "orig", "text": "Pokkhara-vassa 一種前兆之驟雨。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0174003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0174003", "type": "orig", "text": "釋迦族在當時思之為寡頭貴族政體。從而在此處所謂諸王概為幾人貴族之意義。相信釋尊即為如斯之貴族（即所謂之王）一家所生者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175004", "type": "orig", "text": "Gaṃḍambarukkha（Gaṇḍa-amba-uṛksa）kosala 之 pasenadi（波斯匿）王之苑廷 Gaṇḍa 以應獻王之菴婆果獻佛，佛植其種，忽生菴婆樹，以此言為 Gaṇḍambarukkha 出於 J. JV. p. 264。尚於 Sārvatthī（舍衛城）摧伏外道之雙神變於同處及 J. I. p. 88 之外，見 Divy. p. 143（X. II. Prātihārya-Sūtra）；Mahāvastu III. p. 115; Dhp. A. III. p. 474；四分律 L. I（大正藏 XXII. 九四九a）等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175005", "type": "orig", "text": "占相師（Asita）阿私陀之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175006", "type": "orig", "text": "阿私陀仙之占相事見各佛傳。例如見 J. I. p. 54 佛本行經集九（大正藏卷三、六九四b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175007", "type": "orig", "text": "就閻浮樹下靜觀，例如見 J. I. pp. 57-58 佛本行集經十二（大正藏卷三、七〇六a～七〇七a）普曜經三（同四九九c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0178008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0178008", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 cāru; Sabbaṅgi（Stade）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179009", "type": "orig", "text": "Purindada 帝釋（Sakka devānaṁ inda）之別名。Pura-inda（都城之帝王）之意。或亦云為由街至街布施之故。亦云為由毀都城者之義（Purandara）轉化者。見 S. II. 2. 7. 及雜 XL. J（大正藏、II. 三九〇c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179010", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Labheyyaṁ 註釋如斯讀之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179011", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 rajo。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179012", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Khujjādiceṭakākiṇṇe（如佝僂之平伏者等）。原文 Khujjatecalākkhakākiṇṇe 意義不明，Fausboll 讀為 khujjādicelākākiṇṇe。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179013", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Sūtamāgadhavaṇṇite（Fausboll）註釋不明。彈唱詩人之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179014", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為 citraggalerughusite。註釋為等於五件樂器之音豎立快樂之叫聲，依美麗七寶之門柱而豎立之音聲。但 aggala 為門閂之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179015", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋，十願為：一、sivi 王第一后妃之事。二、眼為紺青之事。三、眉為紺青之事。四、附名為 phusatī 之事。五、養王子之事。六、胎不膨大之事。七、乳房不下垂之事。八、不污穢之事。九、皮膚細滑之事。一〇、死刑得免之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0180016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0180016", "type": "orig", "text": "依異本補述。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0182017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0182017", "type": "orig", "text": "Monier-Williams 解為 Visva-ṁ-tara，意為「從一切」（all sabdu ing）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0182018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0182018", "type": "orig", "text": "見 J. VI. pp. 2-3。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0187019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0187019", "type": "orig", "text": "前此之註釋作如次之說明。Jctuttara 市發生動搖。婆羅門等於南門得象，坐於背上，由多數之侍者相從向市之當中進行。大眾見此詢問：「喂！婆羅門諸君乘我等之象，君等由何處牽來耶？」「Vessantara 大王施與我等，貴君為誰耶？」婆羅門等，同等搖手，愚弄大眾，通過市之中央，由北門出去而行。市內以為諸神不在，對菩薩憤慨，集聚於宮門大聲非難……。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0188020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0188020", "type": "orig", "text": "父為剎帝利，母為首陀羅混血之種，勇猛之意。音譯借用郁伽長者之人。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0188021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0188021", "type": "orig", "text": "kalāsa（kailāsa）雪山地方靈山之名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0188022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0188022", "type": "orig", "text": "Sa-athabbaṇa 註釋為 Sa-hatthi-Vejja。但 athabbaṇa（atharvan）據咒術指為 AtharvaVeda。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0189023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0189023", "type": "orig", "text": "據異本讀為 So。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0193024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0193024", "type": "orig", "text": "據異本讀為 dakkhinaṁ vāmahaṁ bahuṁ。（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0196025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0196025", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 ujjalayitvāna。（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0196026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0196026", "type": "orig", "text": "以下之二偈殆由同之 J, V, p. 259 而出。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0203027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0203027", "type": "orig", "text": "Khārikaia Khāri（佉梨）譯為斛，計算穀物量之名。Kāja 為擔棒、天秤棒。即為以擔棒擔一斛量之重物，為出家者之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0205028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0205028", "type": "orig", "text": "Kosiya 即帝釋（Inda）之姓。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0205029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0205029", "type": "orig", "text": "vāruṇī 註釋被捉成為如入於神鬼夜叉之奴婢。言為如巫女者，見三二七頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0205030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0205030", "type": "orig", "text": "就以下之數偈，見 Text, p. 189。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0207031", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0207031", "type": "orig", "text": "註釋述為如斯七百之大布施，爾時 Jetuttara 之市民等皆對 Vessantara 為布施而被追放，但彼更仍行布施出言嘆息而記舉次之偈：「此處囂囂聲起，將有恐怖大騷擾，以布施故爾追放，然爾更仍行布施。」然而更一方受布施之諸人，見 Vessantara 入於森中而悲泣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0208032", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0208032", "type": "orig", "text": "就以下數偈 Text V. p. 258；VI. p. 47 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0209033", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0209033", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 alāra-bhamukhā（Stede）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0209034", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0209034", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 susoñña。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0211035", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0211035", "type": "orig", "text": "abhisasiṁ 註釋為 Pīlesiṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0222036", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0222036", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 assa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231037", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231037", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 nāma so。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0232038", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0232038", "type": "orig", "text": "為 pavisitvā taṁ 之誤植。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0233039", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0233039", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 dve putte。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0236040", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0236040", "type": "orig", "text": "duyyiṭṭhaṁ te navamiyaṁ akataṁ aggihuttakaṁ 意義不明。註釋前半之解釋為：「依貴女第九犧牲祭（navamiyaṁ yāgaṁ）非為正行。貴女之供物（yāga piṇḍa）最初應為老人所取。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0238041", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0238041", "type": "orig", "text": "任何均讀為 agantvā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0239042", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0239042", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 vanṁkā。非固有名詞。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245043", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245043", "type": "orig", "text": "Pāssati 或為 Pissati 之 √pa 之三、單、未來。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245044", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245044", "type": "orig", "text": "Pantha-sakuna「道鳥」之意。註釋為 Pantha-devatā（道之神）。為奉仕道神之鳥之意。此概為鳥等食供道神之生贄（牲畜肉禮）而言。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245045", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245045", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 āhutiṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0246046", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0246046", "type": "orig", "text": "Lābu 瓢簞南瓜之類，為取去中味之容器。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0246047", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0246047", "type": "orig", "text": "原文應讀為 āsadañ camasañ jaṭaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0248048", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0248048", "type": "orig", "text": "為 ūpamo 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249049", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249049", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 uddālakā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249050", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249050", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 puppha。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249051", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249051", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 mañjubhāṇikā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0252052", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0252052", "type": "orig", "text": "與次之二偈為同一之物，出自 J. V. p. 323。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0253053", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0253053", "type": "orig", "text": "與以上二偈殆為同一之物，出自 J. VI. p. 85。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0257054", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0257054", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 varaṇāni。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261055", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261055", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 nikūjita。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263056", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263056", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 nīvāro。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0286057", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0286057", "type": "orig", "text": "依異本讀為 tayo。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0287058", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0287058", "type": "orig", "text": "依異本補足。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0288059", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0288059", "type": "orig", "text": "在「Rāmāyana」中說為十車王之子，拉瑪為兄、西達為妹。此在第四六一十車王本生譚中亦出。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0292060", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0292060", "type": "orig", "text": "依異本讀為 matā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0293061", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0293061", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋補足。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0297062", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0297062", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Padumuppalakehi（見 J. VI. p. 47）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0305063", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0305063", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Pātihariyāni。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0305064", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0305064", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Sandīyati（Stede）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0307065", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0307065", "type": "orig", "text": "與次之二偈為同一之物，出自 J. II. p. 86; IV. p. 65; SN I. p. 19。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0308066", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0308066", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 Sammatha（Stede）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0308067", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0308067", "type": "orig", "text": "殆為同一之偈，出自 J. IV. p. 409。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0308068", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0308068", "type": "orig", "text": "最初之一句亦出自 J. IV. pp. 10. 13. 240; V. p. 161; VI. p. 482。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0311069", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0311069", "type": "orig", "text": "在異本中高尚於此之次為 ajja juthanm, anupatto kuto gacchasi brāhmaṇa 之一句。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0321070", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0321070", "type": "orig", "text": "取異次之 nadantu。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0322071", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0322071", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋：「迦陵伽國之婆羅門等於自國降雨之時，持象歸返刪闍耶王。彼象能會見其持主（即毘輸安呾囉）大為歡喜，蹈足而嗚。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0324072", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0324072", "type": "orig", "text": "帝釋語其父王不久即可前來之事（註釋）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0329073", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0329073", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋：「彼女（Maddi）大聲哭泣顫抖而失神，長仆於地上，兩兒亦又如風之狀奔馳前來呼喚而失神，仆臥於母之身上。爾時彼女之兩乳房流出兩道乳漿，入兩兒之口中。若然如此氣息未絕，兩兒心安亦未氣絕。毘輸安呾囉見愛兒而悲愁不堪，失神而仆倒於其場，而其父母亦失神倒臥於其處。同樣同日生之六萬廷臣等亦見而憐憫，無一人心能平氣。全仙處宛如風吹沙羅樹之狀。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0331074", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0331074", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 rājā（真本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0331075", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0331075", "type": "orig", "text": "讀為 nahāna-kālo（異本）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0332076", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0332076", "type": "orig", "text": "於毘輸安呾囉誕生之日得白象之名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011a0201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0011a0201", "type": "add", "text": "采【CB】，釆【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0018a0201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0018a0201", "type": "add", "text": "鳴【CB】，嗚【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0028a0301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0028a0301", "type": "add", "text": "弧【CB】，孤【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0038a0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0038a0601", "type": "add", "text": "豐【CB】，豊【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058a1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0058a1001", "type": "add", "text": "跌【CB】，趺【南傳】（CBETA 按：參考詞典釋義「蹉跌」為受挫、失勢，今依文意改為「跌」。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065a0501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0065a0501", "type": "add", "text": "豐【CB】，豊【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067a1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0067a1201", "type": "add", "text": "裹【CB】，裏【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0160a1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0160a1001", "type": "add", "text": "婬【CB】，媱【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0162a1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0162a1401", "type": "add", "text": "束【CB】，朿【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199a0501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0199a0501", "type": "add", "text": "鳴【CB】，嗚【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0205a0801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0205a0801", "type": "add", "text": "羸【CB】，嬴【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0205a1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0205a1401", "type": "add", "text": "羸【CB】，嬴【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0302a1301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0302a1301", "type": "add", "text": "波【CB】，婆【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0331a0501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0331a0501", "type": "add", "text": "波【CB】，婆【南傳】"}
